                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a bullet hell game in which you 1v1 a series of bosses in order to unlock pictures. You have one weapon which fires directly ahead, and it does absolutely pitiful damage. Your character moves too slowly, yet there is a dedicated button to make them move even slower. Even when the boss' health meter is empty, they don't die. The bosses love to teleport to the bottom corner of the screen, where you cannot safely attack them. The stages are just a series of static backgrounds. The sprites are tiny and lack any detail. The game crashes literally every time you close it.\n\nIf I could refund this game, I would do so in an instant. Not worth $10. I wouldn't pay $1 for this.",
